            "review_title": "Review at Ben Do Quan",
            "review_text": "thesydneytram\nSydney, Australia1763 contributions\n0\nCountryside style dining\nNov 2022 • Family\nOur family had a fantastic experience at Ben Do Quan- the restaurant by the wharf. We visited the Ben Do during the high tide and had to tiptoe around the water. It was so much fun. \n\nLove the countryside ambience, the delicious food, and the attentive service. Pricing is reasonable.\nWritten December 18, 2022",
