            "review_title": "Review at Ben Do Quan",
            "review_text": "David R\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam105 contributions\n0\nBBQ Vietnamese Restaurant Outdoors On River-Busy Binh Quoi Dining District\nNov 2017 • Friends\nI have been to this restaurant a number of times in the past and last night 11/11 for a meal with Vietnamese friends. The previous time was for my birthday party. The BBQ dishes are always succulent (very tasty) plus the traditional fried Vietnamese dishes. Very economical 6 adults and 2 children for food and drinks about 1,100,000VND. Very good value for money. The seating is outdoors and undercover with plenty of fans and is located on the banks of the Sai Gon River.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 12, 2017",
